# Per-session runtime state written by the gitagent SDK into whatever
# directory it runs against. It is different on every proposal branch,
# so committing it makes every pair of concurrent proposals conflict
# with each other over a session id, puts a false "the agent touched
# files outside the ruleset" warning in front of the analyst, and drops
# noise into a log that is supposed to read as a policy changelog.
.gitagent/
